recommend check-in (Keaton) -- the measurement is done and the first buildable item is BAKERY's lane rather than mine: rank the scope map by cost x (1 - touch_rate). What wants your word is whether eight ships on one 8-thread box is the shape you want, now that the roster's share of it is measured; and the star-graph question still stands from my last lap.
